"Nothing deleted" = "未删除任何内容";
"Nothing to check." = "没有需要检查的内容。";
"Only WQ Files' own folder was found (%lu in total)." = "只找到了 WQ Files 自己的文件夹（共 %lu 个）。";
"Other apps' folders" = "其他 App 的文件夹";
"Put %@ back in\n%@?" = "将 %@ 放回\n%@？";
"Recently Deleted" = "最近删除";
"Sandbox access" = "沙盒访问";
"The app database can't be read properly on iOS %@ (%lu of %lu sampled folders identified). Apps show folder IDs instead of names; backups and restores need the right app, so check before restoring." = "在 iOS %@ 上无法正确读取 App 数据库（%lu / %lu 个抽样文件夹已识别）。App 将显示文件夹 ID 而非名称；备份和还原需要对应正确的 App，请在还原前仔细核对。";
"The scan for them was declined; Apps and the Cache Cleaner stay empty until it runs." = "相关扫描已被拒绝；在扫描运行之前，App 和缓存清理将保持为空。";
"They can't be found on this device (see Log for the reason)." = "在此设备上找不到它们（原因请查看日志）。";
"Try Again" = "重试";
"WQ Files can't work properly here" = "WQ Files 无法在此正常运行";
"WQ Files stopped here instead of showing empty or wrong lists. A new iOS version can block its sandbox access; please send the Log with your device and iOS version." = "WQ Files 已在此停止，而不是显示空的或错误的列表。新的 iOS 版本可能会阻止其沙盒访问；请将日志连同你的设备和 iOS 版本一起发送。";
"iOS %@ hasn't been tested with this version of WQ Files." = "iOS %@ 尚未在此版本的 WQ Files 上测试过。";
"iOS version" = "iOS 版本";
"Reset Access Cache" = "重置访问缓存";
"Reset Access Cache?" = "重置访问缓存？";
"Another app that shares WQ Files' App Group (for example one signed with the same tool) can leave its cache folder in a state that blocks sandbox access. This puts it back; nothing is deleted." = "与 WQ Files 共用 App Group 的其他应用（例如用同一工具签名的应用）可能会让其缓存文件夹处于阻止沙盒访问的状态。此操作会将其恢复；不会删除任何内容。";
"Reset" = "重置";
"Reset failed" = "重置失败";
"The App Group is missing." = "缺少 App Group。";
"All" = "全部";
"Apple" = "Apple";
"Other" = "其他";
"Deleting…" = "正在删除…";
"Cancelled" = "已取消";
"Files are copied to Backups first." = "文件会先复制到备份。";
"This folder can't be deleted: it holds an app's or the system's data." = "无法删除此文件夹：其中包含应用或系统的数据。";
"%@\n\nThis folder holds an app's or the system's data and can't be deleted here." = "%@\n\n此文件夹包含应用或系统的数据，无法在此删除。";
"%lu files (%@) in total, including everything in the folders. Each file is copied to Backups first and can be restored from Recently Deleted." = "共 %lu 个文件（%@），包括文件夹中的所有内容。每个文件都会先复制到备份，可在“最近删除”中恢复。";
"%lu of %lu files" = "%lu / %lu 个文件";
"%lu files were deleted (copies are in Backups), then:\n%@" = "已删除 %lu 个文件（副本在备份中），随后：\n%@";
"%lu apps and extensions checked: none has 64 KB or more in its caches and temporary files." = "已检查 %lu 个应用和扩展：没有任何一个的缓存和临时文件达到 64 KB。";
"Crash Logs can't be fully measured on this device." = "此设备上无法完整测量崩溃日志。";
"Restore returns a file to its original location. Delete Backup removes the selected copy. Older copies may still be available." = "“还原”会将文件放回原始位置。“删除备份”会移除所选副本。较早的副本可能仍然可用。";
"Delete Backups…" = "删除备份…";
"This removes the selected backup of %@. Older copies may still be available." = "将删除 %@ 的所选备份。较早的副本可能仍然可用。";
"This removes %lu backed-up files, including other files in the selected backups. Older copies may still be available." = "将删除 %lu 个已备份的文件，包括所选备份中的其他文件。较早的副本可能仍然可用。";
"Items not moved: %lu of %lu.\n\n%@" = "未移动: %lu / %lu.\n\n%@";
"Items not deleted: %lu of %lu.\n\n%@" = "未删除: %lu / %lu.\n\n%@";
"This text has bytes that aren't plain UTF-8 (invalid or NUL bytes), so editing it here would change bytes you didn't touch. Use SQL with a hex literal, for example UPDATE t SET c = CAST(X'610062' AS TEXT) WHERE rowid = 1." = "此文本包含非纯 UTF-8 的字节（无效字节或 NUL 字节），在此编辑会改动您未触及的字节。请使用带十六进制字面量的 SQL，例如 UPDATE t SET c = CAST(X'610062' AS TEXT) WHERE rowid = 1。";
"The value was changed in the copy, but the row could not be read again. Go back to see the current rows." = "副本中的值已更改，但无法重新读取该行。请返回查看当前的行。";
"The ZIP file is ambiguous (it has more than one directory)" = "ZIP 文件有歧义（包含多个目录）";
"This ZIP has too many items (more than %lu)." = "此 ZIP 的项目过多（超过 %lu 个）。";
"The ZIP contains a path that is too long or too deep (%@); nothing was extracted." = "ZIP 包含过长或过深的路径（%@）；未解压任何内容。";
"1 item couldn't be read (no permission) and is not in the ZIP." = "1 个项目无法读取（没有权限），未包含在 ZIP 中。";
"%lu items couldn't be read (no permission) and are not in the ZIP." = "%lu 个项目无法读取（没有权限），未包含在 ZIP 中。";
"Some items left out" = "部分项目被省略";
"The data names an invalid app identifier (%@)." = "数据指定了无效的应用标识符（%@）。";
"This data names more than one app (%@). Importing it as a backup of %@ (%@) and restoring it can break the app." = "此数据指定了多个应用（%@）。将其作为 %@（%@）的备份导入并恢复可能会损坏该应用。";
"%@ An unfinished copy remains in %@." = "%@ 未完成的副本仍在 %@ 中。";
"Finishing…" = "正在完成…";
"It had already finished when you cancelled, so the result was kept." = "取消时操作已经完成，因此保留了结果。";
"The item was moved, replaced or changed after it was selected. It was left as it is." = "该项目在选择后已被移动、替换或更改。已保持原样。";
"Files are copied to Backups first. Links and special files (pipes, sockets) are removed without a backup and can't be restored." = "文件会先复制到备份。链接和特殊文件（管道、套接字）会在没有备份的情况下删除，且无法恢复。";
"%lu links or special files (pipes, sockets) are removed without a backup and can't be restored." = "%lu 个链接或特殊文件（管道、套接字）会在没有备份的情况下删除，且无法恢复。";
"Counting stopped at %lu items, so there may be more." = "计数已在 %lu 个项目处停止，因此可能还有更多。";
"Some folders or items could not be read, so these totals may be incomplete. Anything in them that is not a regular file is removed without a backup." = "部分文件夹或项目无法读取，因此这些总数可能不完整。其中不是普通文件的内容会在没有备份的情况下删除。";
"Backups could not be read: %@" = "无法读取备份：%@";
"Some backups could not be read, so this list may be incomplete." = "部分备份无法读取，因此此列表可能不完整。";
"Backup was edited" = "备份已被修改";
"The files in %@ of this backup changed after WQ Files made it, for example because files from another backup were put in. Restore the backup as it is now? The app's current data is still backed up first." = "此备份中 %@ 的文件在 WQ Files 创建后发生了变化，例如放入了另一个备份中的文件。要按现在的状态恢复此备份吗？应用的当前数据仍会先备份。";
"Restore Anyway" = "仍然恢复";
"Replace existing files?" = "替换现有文件？";
"%lu of the %lu files already exist here. Replace them (each is backed up first) or keep both?" = "%lu 个文件（共 %lu 个）已存在于此。要替换它们（每个都会先备份）还是两者都保留？";
"Keep Both" = "两者都保留";
"Replace All" = "全部替换";
